{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>Black Friday購物季又到喇！由11月20日至12月6日，各區門市推出超狂優惠，今次幫大家精選了最矚目的限量「福車」及半價好物，大家準備好大出血未？\n</p>\n<p>Aeon Black Friday購物季<br/>\n📍地點：全線AEON、AEON STYLE及AEON SUPERMARKET（部分貨品只限指定分店）<br/>\n📅日期：2026年11月20日至12月6日<br/>\n🩵留言「買」Send更詳細優惠詳情給你～</p>\n<p>購物提案 ｜ 為你搜羅各地購物好去處，分享各種消費攻略，等你買得有眼光！即刻DM我哋分享你嘅購物提案！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507522380994944_9630646436afeac9877ded.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507522380994944_9630646436afeac9877ded.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：GOtrip編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Df6d1a9T3ZC/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/aeon/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AEON</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/blackfriday/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BlackFriday</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%b3%bc%e7%89%a9%e6%94%bb%e7%95%a5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">購物攻略</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：GOtrip編輯部資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Df6d1a9T3ZC/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 19 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:14:06.639200+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":403,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","c